Source: rate-adjusting-pcm-ring
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Chris Peterson <cpeter1207@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libsamplerate0-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/cpeter1207/rate_adjusting_pcm_ring
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: librate-adjusting-pcm-ring1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: lock-free rate-adjusting PCM playout ring
 Shared library for a single-producer/single-consumer signed PCM ring with
 persistent libsamplerate clock recovery and bounded packet-loss concealment.

Package: librate-adjusting-pcm-ring-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, librate-adjusting-pcm-ring1 (= ${binary:Version}), libsamplerate0-dev
Description: development files for the rate-adjusting PCM playout ring
 Header and pkg-config metadata for applications that link dynamically against
 the ABI-major 1 rate-adjusting PCM playout ring.
